583=5389. This is very good for me. So set: {B35, A10, C00, B86, A87, B32, C01, B41}. Total effort 4021, importance 5389. But maybe we can add a small item? A77 (77,65), but effort 4021+77=4098>4026, no. So this is a good set for me. Alternatively, we could replace B41 with something else? But B41 is efficient. Another high importance item is A71, but it has high effort and lower efficiency. So I think this set is optimal for me. Now, I should propose this set to start with. However, I must include an ARGUMENT, so I will argue that this set has high value and fits well under the limit. Also, I need to be open to negotiation since the other might have different preferences.'}

